# ============================================================
#  Archetypes (design §10.4): templates for side characters spawned
#  in phase 4. Names come from per-language pools
#  (locales/<lang>/names.lang). Every character is an adult.
# ============================================================

@archetype student
names: pool students
age: 18..22
traits: pick 2
pronouns: any
house: any
role: student
desc: A fellow student: a face in the corridor who might become a friend, a rival or a story.

@archetype professor
names: pool professors
age: 35..72
traits: pick 2
pronouns: any
house: Faculty
role: professor
desc: A visiting or junior member of the faculty: an advisor, an examiner or an internship supervisor.

@archetype villager
names: pool villagers
age: 18..80
traits: pick 1
pronouns: any
house: none
role: outsider
desc: Someone from the village across the lake: a shopkeeper, a bargeman, a customer at the Gilded Newt.

@archetype northerner
names: pool northerners
age: 18..40
traits: pick 2
pronouns: any
house: none
role: outsider
desc: A traveller from the frozen North, with frost in their eyelashes and loyalties that are hard to read.
